They just find it very tasty.
Once checked off, you can't use a treasure again.
The rules are just words on a page, the true game goes on in your head: =
Only you can create the story.
So, have each player state what will happen if they succeed in the roll, =
and the person to the left describe what will happen if the roller =
fails. "Hex" is a one page solitaire RPG by Jeff Moore inspired by =
"Doom: Semper Fidelis" by Sandy Antunes.
With apologies to Ms.
Abstract Nova EntertainmentAbstract Nova Entertainment is a new =
publisher committed to producing imaginative role-playing games and =
supplements.
Each player takes the role of a normal Japanese student.
Let's move into combat training.
This is your time to shine, poor misunderstood Owlbear! He is dressed in =
chain armor and the heraldry on his surcoat indicates that he is =
affiliated with the keep behind you. This is what drives your character =
forward; what keeps them on the path toward their destination, and, most =
importantly, that which they value the most in the world. As an example, =
for a two player game the players choose to be a young couple on their =
honeymoon in Hawaii.
Abstract Nova EntertainmentAbstract Nova Entertainment is a new =
publisher committed to producing imaginative role-playing games and =
supplements.
It is now a beachhead for a demonic invasion of Earth. Nothing and no =
one is able to stand in their way. Each player takes the role of a =
normal Japanese student. It is assumed for the purpose of the game that =
the family is composed of poor country folk. The Compendium is a free =
service provided for gamers by gamers, and continues to grow.
Their abilities are only limited by their own personality. It consists =
of just one page, on which you can find both the rules and sections for =
recording your character's statistics. 
